{{!
    @template local_edusupport/post_mailtext

    The text mail telling a subscriber about a new post in an issue.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * coursename The name of the course.
    * forumname The name of the forum.
    * discussionname The name of the discussion.
    * issuelink The address of the issue.
    * subject The subject of the post.
    * authorfullname The name of the author.
    * postdate When the post was written.
    * message The post.
    * attachments The attachments, if any.
    * replylink The address to reply at.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "coursename": "Support area",
        "forumname": "Support forum",
        "discussionname": "Printer is broken",
        "issuelink": "https://example.com/local/edusupport/issue.php?d=12",
        "subject": "Printer is broken",
        "authorfullname": "Sally Student",
        "postdate": "11. September 2026, 15:30",
        "message": "The printer in room 12 does not print.",
        "attachments": "",
        "replylink": "https://example.com/local/edusupport/issue.php?d=12&replyto=34"
    }
}}

{{{ coursename }}} -> {{# str }} forums, forum {{/ str }} -> {{{ forumname }}} -> {{{ discussionname }}}
{{ issuelink }}
{{{ subject }}}
{{# str }} bynameondate, forum, {
        "name": {{# quote }}{{{ authorfullname }}}{{/ quote }},
        "date": {{# quote}}{{ postdate }}{{/ quote }}
    } {{/ str }}
---------------------------------------------------------------------
{{{ message }}}

{{{ attachments }}}
---------------------------------------------------------------------

{{# str }} postmailinfolink, local_edusupport, {
    "coursename": {{# quote }}{{{ coursename }}}{{/ quote }},
    "replylink": {{# quote }}{{ replylink }}{{/ quote }}
} {{/ str }}
